/**
 * Converts an array of Gemini `Part` objects into the internal `ContentPart`
 * representation.
 *
 * - `text` parts become `{ type: 'text' }`.
 * - `thought` parts become `{ type: 'thought' }`, carrying `thoughtSignature`
